            "description": "After cooling, aseptically and anaerobically, add the following solutions from anaerobic stocks (filtersterilized): Dispense the medium into culture vessels (e.g., 5 ml medium in Hungate tubes) under a H2-CO2 (80:20, v/v) gas stream and seal with butyl stoppers."
