accessed=2026-10-08T13:22:45.762376+00:00; capture SHA256=a2ba84bc75a35379b464d5ac8a7ce0f787642b69838cdc2b4763a5657555edba.\n\nAdditional exact excerpt: \"Mix ingredients, except yeast extract, peptone, vitamins, sulfur and Na2S・9H2O, and autoclave under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Separately autoclave yeast extract and peptone as 10% solutions and Na2S・9H2O as a 5% solution under a N2 atmosphere. Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Filter--sterilize NaHCO3 as an 8% solution and vitamin solution while gassing with N2. Aseptically and anaerobically add yeast extract, peptone, NaHCO3 and vitamin solutions, and sulfur to the medium under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Prior to inoculation, add the sterile Na2S・9H2O solution, and adjust pH to 6.2--6.4 with sterile 1 N H2SO4.\"\nsolutions[3].preparation_notes: The source specifies a separate percentage-labelled preparation but does not establish percentage basis or its addition volume. No numeric stock strength or dose is asserted. Composition notes record the receiving-batch contribution only. No final-medium volume, percentage basis, density or chemical grounding is inferred. Locator=comments[0].comment; accessed=2026-10-08T13:22:45.762376+00:00; capture SHA256=a2ba84bc75a35379b464d5ac8a7ce0f787642b69838cdc2b4763a5657555edba.\n\nAdditional exact excerpt: \"Mix ingredients, except yeast extract, peptone, vitamins, sulfur and Na2S・9H2O, and autoclave under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Separately autoclave yeast extract and peptone as 10% solutions and Na2S・9H2O as a 5% solution under a N2 atmosphere. Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Filter--sterilize NaHCO3 as an 8% solution and vitamin solution while gassing with N2. Aseptically and anaerobically add yeast extract, peptone, NaHCO3 and vitamin solutions, and sulfur to the medium under a N2--CO2 (80:20) atmosphere. Prior to inoculation, add the sterile Na2S・9H2O solution, and adjust pH to 6.2--6.4 with sterile 1 N H2SO4.\"\nsolutions[4